{"hw":"χάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">χάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">χάω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">contr.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">χῶ,</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = χωρῶ, coined as etym. of <span class=\"gk\">χάος</span> by <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Simp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">620.14</span> </span>.</div></div>"}